<Base
  title="About | K-Entertainment, Explained"
  description="About K-Entertainment, Explained — human-reviewed explainers about Korean entertainment stories that made international news, for English-speaking readers."
>
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p>
    K-Entertainment, Explained covers Korean entertainment stories that made
    news outside Korea — K-pop milestones, K-drama and film breakouts, award
    wins, and cultural moments — written for readers who saw a headline and
    want the background and context behind it.
  </p>
  <p>
    Posts start as AI-assisted drafts and are reviewed, fact-checked, and
    edited by a human before publishing. This site is written and edited by
    Chris Kim.
  </p>
  <p>
    We link to and reference reputable news coverage rather than presenting
    unverified claims or rumors as fact, and we don't cover private/personal
    matters that aren't already widely and reliably reported. Photos on this
    site are AI-generated illustrations, not real photos of the people or
    events discussed.
  </p>
  <p>
    Spotted something inaccurate, or have a story suggestion? Reach out via
    the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
  </p>
</Base>
